    "sub_ename": "PRACTICE OF SPECIAL TOPICS",
    "describe_ch": "此課程乃建設學院碩士班碩一下之必修課。內容依各系所之專業領域聘請校外業師來校指導不同題目，並利用校內外多方的資源，讓學生動手做出成品。",
    "describe_eh": "This is a required course for first-year master students in Spring Semester in the Collage of Construction and Development. Based on their respective professional fields, different departments will invite industrial experts to instruct in different special topics. By using resources inside and outside of school, students will be required to create their own final products.",
